## Problem classes

### `Verify skipped because there is no Go`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Task marked green after informal script run | Makefile still a Go skeleton, or unit tests alone counted as verify | Restore POSIX Makefile: `verify: lint test build` with shellcheck + `tests/run.sh` + pack-check |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Test installed into the real home`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `~/.claude/skills` changed during `make test` | Script used `$HOME` instead of a fixture | Export `HOME` to a temp dir in tests; assert only that tree |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Empty glob aborts under set -u`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Script dies on an empty pack/dir with `unbound variable` | Empty glob stored in an array, then `"${arr[@]}"` under `set -u` (bash 3.2) | `shopt -s nullglob`; `for dir in "$root"/*/`; skip files; do not expand an empty array |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Expected failure aborts the test runner`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Test script exits before asserting a non-zero status | `set -e` plus `cmd; echo $?` | `code=0; cmd || code=$?` then assert `$code` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Empty pack directory is untracked`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `skills/` missing after clone / first commit | Git does not store empty directories | Keep a non-skill placeholder file in the pack dir; pack-check ignores files and only requires `SKILL.md` inside subdirectories |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Sandbox blocks fake HOME .cursor`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `mkdir: …/.cursor: Operation not permitted` in installer tests; claude dests already passed | Cursor sandbox treats `.cursor` as protected even under a temp `HOME` | Re-run `make verify` outside the sandbox. Product dest is still `"$HOME/.cursor/skills"` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `grep treats the needle as flags`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `grep: unrecognized option '--list'` (or `-g`) in tests | Pattern starts with `-` and was passed without `--` | `grep -F -- "$needle" file` |

